sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Landlord as Asha (Landlord)
  participant API as LeaseLedger API
  participant DB as MongoDB
  actor Tenant as Ravi (Tenant)

  Landlord->>API: POST /api/v1/tenancies/:id/invitations { email }
  Note over API: Generate 32-byte crypto random token<br/>Compute SHA-256 hash<br/>Set expiresAt = +7 days
  API->>DB: Save Invitation (status: PENDING, tokenHash)
  API-->>Landlord: 201 Created { shareUrl: /join/:rawToken }

  Landlord->>Tenant: Dispatches invite link via email/chat
  Tenant->>API: GET /api/v1/invitations/:rawToken
  Note over API: Compute SHA-256(rawToken)<br/>Query DB by tokenHash
  DB-->>API: Invitation Document (status: PENDING, valid expiry)
  API-->>Tenant: 200 OK (Tenancy details & property address)

  Tenant->>API: POST /api/v1/invitations/:rawToken/accept
  Note over API: Verify authenticated tenant user<br/>Atomically add tenant._id to tenancy.tenants<br/>Update Invitation (status: ACCEPTED, acceptedBy)
  API->>DB: Persist Tenancy update & Invitation closure
  API-->>Landlord: Notification (Tenant Joined Tenancy)
  API-->>Tenant: 200 OK (Redirect to /tenancies/:id)
